  "text": {
    "en": {
      "name": "Xenovader\u25b3 of Sky Sheol",
      "effect": "If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: Banish (face-down) the top 2 cards of your Deck. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Xenovader\u25b3 of Sky Sheol\" once per turn. If this card is in your hand and you control a \"Xenovader\u25b3\" monster: You can Special Summon this card. During your Main Phase: You can add up to 2 of your face-down banished \"Xenovader\u25b3\" Spells/Traps with different names to your hand, also you cannot activate cards or effects for the rest of this turn, except \"Xenovader\u25b3\" cards or effects.",
      "official": false
    },
    "ja": {
